# Authoritative TabbyRush reuse decisions
Date:2026-10-13. Planning only. This package supersedes both earlier TabbyRush planning directories and its own100h existing-protocol baseline. Current [architecture](../architecture.md) and [contracts](../contracts.md) reflect user-selected strict sync.

## Confirmed product decisions
1. Reuse **Glean Hub authentication AND schema backend**; replace Worker/D1 entirely. Native Hub email/password login and username/email/password signup,not browser-cookie SSO/OAuth/custom TabbyRush password backend.
2. Native app-access request/status flow; existing Hub administrator approves tabbyrush. `/me.apps` current grant,not request approval record or client-decoded JWT.
3. User initially selected current sync, then validation requested stronger guarantees if feasible/report first. Two feasibility slices and primary Mongo documentation establish conditional architectural feasibility. User subsequently selected **TabbyRush-only strict per-record sync (A)**, not transactional receipt/snapshot design B or baseline fallback.
4. Strict A: server-owned exact revision CAS,insert-only create,immutable retry at most one logical effect,permanent compact deletion markers,stable-key full scans. Explicit UnknownSuperseded review accepted when lost acknowledgement is superseded by another edit; no snapshot/history/exactly-once claim. Deleted title removed; retained identity/revision metadata grows with lifetime deletes.
5. **Existing embedded apps stay unchanged.** Actual repo directory is `/home/loidinh/WS/glean-hub/embed-app/`,not under glean-hub-app. Parent traced cham-lang/code-notes/fin-catch/immersive-language-learning/money-insight shared TypeScript sync client; it still calls legacy push/pull/delta. No update/rebuild/data migration of embedded apps or Rust/TS shared client required for TabbyRush opt-in. Actual compatibility smoke remains mandatory.
6. Admin accounts **allowed with warning**,recommend non-admin; stored admin JWT remains privileged despite absent admin UI. **Local-only logout accepted**; no shared auth/revocation redesign.
7. Retain offline edits,Room KMP+bundled SQLite,OS-private DB without separate encryption,protected platform credentials,guarded wipe on logout/switch,Android background work,ForumFlash-inspired light-only UI. Android first on headless Fedora/SSH Xpra; installed Linux RPM next; Windows MSI manually on another machine.
8. Planning only. **First implementation step Phase01 headless tooling/Android environment**,not Hub code or installs now. Revised estimate148h,uncertainty±25–35%,ideal dependency path96h excludes waits/rework; not runtime evidence.

## Source facts — source beats stale docs
Paths relative to `/home/loidinh/WS/glean-hub/`.
- `glean-hub-server/src/routes/auth.rs:44-63,107-134`; main mount `/api/v1`: login/register/refresh public,me JWT only. Models camelCase,login email/password,registration returns identity/token pair.
- `src/services/auth_service.rs:42-95`: Argon2,HS256 claims sub/apps/is_admin/exp,access6h (not stale1h docs),no observed issuer/audience/JWKS/OIDC. `:116-174` refresh random32bytes,hashSHA256,30days;old token consumed before separate new creation. Uncertain dispatch may need reauth.
- `/me` reads current user; sync dual_auth.rs:35-90 trusts JWT app-grant snapshot plus app key;user owner from sub. Removal may leave old JWT usable until expiry. No admin bypass to tabbyrush grant.
- No observed logout/password-reset/introspection/JWKS/key-rotation API. App registration returns app key once and stores its hash. Key-only insufficient for user data; public native binary cannot prove its own identity.
- `sync_service.rs:330-401` legacy client versions+greater-than conflict+absent upsert;`:487-534` timestamp-string non-snapshot pagination;`:670-750`physical purge/non-CAS restore. These legacy semantics remain for existing apps,not TabbyRush strict protocol.
- [Source review](contract-review.md) documents overloaded401/access-request duplicate behavior,refresh consumption,grant approval non-atomicity,invalid data,worker/leave gaps. [Isolation review](strong-sync-isolation-feasibility.md) traces legacy writers/cleanup/notification namespaces and mode/read-back requirements.

## Strict architecture choices
Separate optional immutable schema mode `strict-v1`,new strong bootstrap/push/pull routes under existing dual-auth/rate/body gate,and per-app/epoch non-`app*` storage. Missing mode remains legacy;strict mode cannot downgrade. Existing registration/update callers stay valid;isolated strict path uses real new behavior,not obsolete compatibility shims. Existing engine DTOs/clients/admin UI unchanged.
New admin `/strict-apps` avoids oldbinary silent legacy registration;read-back mode/epoch still mandatory. Intrinsic `_id=userId:rowId`,ordinary simple-collation/noTTL collection and exact scan index verified before registry publication/admission. Every request reads active registry epoch before namespace access;only admission cached. New legacy-only router guard rejects strict/unknown modes;old apps absentmode unchanged. Existing sync service/purge/job/coreclient files need no changes;namespace isolation verified by real bypass gates.
Single-document atomic CAS includes logical row,server revision and lastOp. Replay confirmation uses actual metadata nonce write with journaled concern,not no-op/visible read. Operation digest canonical cross-language framing frozen02;client never retargets a frozen request. Last-op superseded can preserve historical uncertainty;no global receipt ledger or automatic rebase.
Stable rowId scans include permanent canonical-empty tombstones;staging only complete scans,retain higher confirmed revision and post-scan-start acknowledgements. Same-epoch previously known missing identity pauses inconsistency/reset,not deletion/recreation. Full scans eventual after quiescence,not snapshots. Epoch isolation prevents old requests touching fresh namespace;old-namespace late commit remains possible.
08 recovery script quiesces/retires writers,fresh external epoch/newnamespace,imports approved rows revision1+lastOpnull;03 real read-only admission helper verifies candidate before journaled registryepoch CAS. PreCASfailure retains oldpointer;CAS ambiguity MAYcommit,traffic blocked until authoritative reconciliation,no blind retry/epoch regeneration. Actual readmission/bootstrap/oldepoch409 gate reopen. No receipt inference,rolledbackepoch/auto outboxrebase/storage-loss guarantee. Replica explicit majority+journal/primaryreads;standalone journal,noHA;global defaults unchanged.

## Account and native lifecycle
Room origin+exact-user partition full SHA256 with unambiguous framing. Base,outbox,drafts,staging,meta separate;tokens never in SQLite. Atomic visible edit+durable intent;frozen dispatch before socket;per-row FIFO;captured revision/generation prevents late reply clearing new edit/account.
Android direct Keystore wrapped atomic bundle;Linux Secret Service fail-closed;Windows userDPAPI+ACL. No deprecated EncryptedSharedPreferences/file-encryption-with-unprotected-key fallback. Single-flight refresh,persist successor before waiters;failure pauses workers with durable recovery marker;reauth retains work. Auth04 emits frozen callback,metadata05 handles persistence.
Foreground+Android worker share default-process coordinator/refresh lock. Unique one-shot+periodic15min best effort;no force-stop/timing promise;drain/re-enqueue during work. Desktop only while open,single profile process. Normal close preserves established offline account;fresh login/switch online.
