- `services/sync_service.rs:154-451`: per-record optimistic version checks, explicit syncedRecords/conflicts/failures, not batch transaction. Stored version is client supplied. Known older assumedServerVersion conflicts; no assumption skips that check. Use known assumption in TabbyRush, never omit to force overwrite.
