1. **Syntax Checks**:
   - `bash -n scripts/android-smoke.sh`: **PASS** (Zero syntax errors; `--help` exits 0).
   - `node --check scripts/debug-fault-proxy.mjs`: **PASS** (Zero syntax errors; verified route allowlist and 2xx upstream assertion).
