## Essential semantic choices
Do not defer product semantics to implementer. Explicit conservative defaults, identify interview candidates:
- General task observer reuses current invalidation after successful mutations; all-todos snapshot filter-independent; stable incomplete/completed ordering; initial replay/cold load; sync changes and conflicts converge without Activity alive.
- Store desired completion by ID under one mutation lock, fresh state, preserve title/temporal/outbox invariants, duplicate desired=true no-op. No stale full Todo copy, recursive mutex, DAO bypass, or nested gate inversion. Tombstone/missing fail no-op; stale generation rejects before mutation. Widget desired state both ways; notification explicit true.
- Define notification eligibility separate from reminder predicate. Preserve existing projection conflict knowledge; explicitly decide conflict display rule without silently inheriting reminder-enabled/conflict suppression. No submitted editor drafts. Date-only next-day overdue boundary not morning reminder anchor. Specify equality at boundary and sort fields (recommended effective due boundary overdueEpochMs, then taskId) for both overdue and upcoming; rationale explicit.
- Account readiness: explicit Restoring/Ready/SignedOut/Locked/Unavailable, bounded wait not infinite authenticated-Flow await. Current account+generation token validated under admitted runtime access before read/write/OS publication. Re-check changed account just before publishing old snapshot; drain/cancel in-flight work on leave and startup recovery. Never getOrCreateAccountRuntime(stale key).
- Settings local/account-scoped outside Room; notification default off. Request POST_NOTIFICATIONS from actual ActivityResult flow after opt-in, own channel unavailable states on resume; reminder controls independent.
- Persist suppression keyed to generation/task/deadline; same selected key stays suppressed across sync/time/process restart, even title edit. Clear on selection key changes/disappears or deliberate reenable; programmatic cancel must not masquerade as user dismissal. No immediate repost.
- Optional next-boundary work is inexact and unconstrained by network; no permanent polling/new exact-alarm permission/FGS. Cancel account-tagged surface jobs at leave. Do not change sync cadence.
- Compact desktop quick-add separate input model from main editor, existing validation/default semantics, shared controller. Single runtime, singleton windows/tray, explicit quit only teardown/exit; no usable tray => last-visible window retains explicit restore/quit UI. Manual relaunch sticky preferences, full monitor work areas/negative coords/DPI reachability; no autostart/activation IPC scope creep.
- Linux generic implementation already exists after desktop phases; phase08 owns only Linux-specific adaptations/doc/evidence, returns common defects to original file owner rather than claiming duplicate ownership. Pending machine = pending acceptance, never complete.

