Plan estimates are estimates, not deadlines. Implementation not authorized by plan. Exact Glance1.2.0 is researcher candidate only, must verify actual compile/runtime with Kotlin2.1.10/Compose1.7.3/min26/SDK35. Pinned desktop API supported by cited source but runtime not proven.
Tests target behavior/boundaries only, real SQLite for storage; no source-string tests, copies/wiring mocks, incidental default assertions. Compile/smoke planned per owner, final aggregate verification once after integration; native launcher/notification/window/tray proof required, not builds alone. Use future Windows `gradlew.bat` and existing desktop runDebug entry; Linux host-mismatch guard honored. No broad unrelated backend/schema/Windows native toast work.
Docs phase07 owns affected README/PDR/architecture/codebase-summary/standards/design/lifecycle/acceptance/security docs/changelog/roadmap only where changed, exact paths; phase08 owns Linux acceptance/guide/evidence. Avoid historical overclaim fixes outside scope.

