## 4. Suggestions (Low Priority / Maintainability)

### [SUGG-1] Android Notification Missing `ContentIntent` Deep Link
- **Location**: `androidApp/src/main/kotlin/dev/tabbyrush/android/android-notification-adapter.kt:146`
