  - `androidApp/src/main/kotlin/dev/tabbyrush/android/android-account-state-manager.kt`: Atomic file swaps for `active_account.dat` and startup pending wipe recovery executing `syncScheduler.cancelAndAwait(key)` inside `runBlocking` before SQLite deletion.
